# The ERP image is built from the repository root (the module root), so
# keep the build context to the Go module. Everything below is either
# irrelevant to a `go build` or must never enter an image: git history,
# local credential scratch, run output, brand binaries, built binaries.
.git
.gitignore
.env
bin/
backups/
brand/
docs/
k8s/
.github/
.synthetic-upstream/
__pycache__/
*.out
*.md
